      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. can you expand on the part about it being a 'necessary remedy'? like, i want to argue that the idea of meritocracy is basically just a myth used to defend the status quo. how can i frame that so it sounds like a solid sociological critique rather than just an opinion?",
